          "message": {
            "text": "Secrets such as the bearer token for edge-gateway appear in process arguments and environment dumps that diagnostic tooling captures. Because edge-gateway serves the Edge DMZ, a single failure here reaches each consumer of inbound API requests at once. The exposed material can be reused for follow-on attacks and may trigger notification duties if it covers customer data. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
