          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/information-disclosure",
          "message": {
            "text": "Logs and traces emitted by worker-2 include raw work orders and route candidates, so anyone with access to the logging pipeline can read content meant for one tenant. Because worker-2 serves the Agent Runtime Zone, a single failure here reaches each consumer of work orders and route candidates at once. Disclosure is silent, so the affected parties learn about it only when the information is misused. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and MEDIUM impact because the effect is bounded to one workflow or one tenant and can be corrected with effort.",
