        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/information-disclosure",
          "message": {
            "text": "embedded documents and metadata held by vector-store-a are readable by any service in the Data Zone that shares the same network role, because access is granted by network position. The exposure follows from how vector-store-a receives embedded documents and metadata from worker-2 and hands them to the next stage without an independent check. The exposed material can be reused for follow-on attacks and may trigger notification duties if it covers customer data. Rated HIGH likelihood because the path needs no special position and uses interfaces that are exposed by design, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
            "markdown": "Grant access to embedded documents and metadata per workload identity with least privilege, enforce it at vector-store-a and remove network-position trust within the Data Zone. Add a regression test for this abuse path to the CI suite and alert through audit-ledger when the control fires."
          },
