        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/stride/elevation-of-privilege",
          "message": {
            "text": "planner-agent runs with broader permissions than its function needs, so a flaw in handling task plans and tool selections yields access to unrelated resources. Because planner-agent serves the Agent Runtime Zone, a single failure here reaches each consumer of task plans and tool selections at once. Once the boundary is crossed the attacker can reach administrative functions and persist there. Rated MEDIUM likelihood because the path needs a foothold on a neighbouring service or a prepared request, and HIGH impact because the affected data or action is central to shipment handling and hard to reverse.",
