        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/llm-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "Markdown or HTML produced by worker-2 contains remote images that leak data when a client renders it. vector-store-a trusts worker-2 to pass work orders and route candidates along unchanged, which removes the second chance to catch the problem downstream. The unsafe output reaches an interpreter that trusts it, turning a text generation problem into code or request execution. Rated LOW likelihood because the path needs several preconditions to line up, such as insider access or a rare timing window, and LOW impact because the effect is contained and easy to reverse once it is noticed.",
            "markdown": "Strip remote resources from the output of worker-2 before display, proxy images through a controlled service and disable automatic loading. Verify the control in a pre-production exercise and review it again after any change to worker-2."
